Z||000001||87GT||10-30-1999||04:51 PM||||I have always heard that the notchback fieros with the V6 are slightly quicker because of the weight difference.  I saw the times from 0-60 before but I cant remember exactly what they were.  ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Formula||10-30-1999||05:52 PM||||I think the Formula (notchback) with the 5-speed transmission without a/c power windows etc.... (base Formula) was the fastest from the factory.||||reg||1
Z||000003||ChadMan||10-30-1999||06:19 PM||||Rumor has it the quickest Fieros (0-60 or 1/4 mile) were the 4-speed V6 cars from 1985/1986, but I think the 5-speed V6 cars from 1986.5-1988 have a higher top speed.  The differences are marginal in either case.||||reg||1
