Z||000006||fiero56||10-30-1999||09:13 PM||||I've always heard the quickest Fiero was the 1985 GT 4-speed.  It was supposed to put out more power than the 1986 and later v-6 engines due to more stringent emissions restrictions placed in 1986 and later.  The second quickest from what I've heard is the 1988 Formula with a 5-speed.  Which I am proud to say, "that's me"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">. After these two were supposed to be the GT's.  I've never seen actual documented proof though on any of this speculation, sounds good to me though.<p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 10-30-1999).]||||reg||1
