Z||000009||88 Fiero||10-31-1999||11:50 AM||||According to Gary Witzenburg...when test performance data was issued regarding the different years on the Fiero the fastest stock V6 recorded by Car and Driver was the 1986GT was 7.5 sec to 60. The next one was the '88GT tested by Auto Week 7.8 sec to 60. Next was the '88 Formula tested by Car and Driver at 7.9 sec to 60. the 4.10 gears were not offered on the V6 Fiero even in '85. This final gear was only offered on 4 cylinder Fiero althought you could install one for the V6 Fiero. My friend keith got one on his '86SE V6...||||reg||1
