Z||000017||bHooper||11-04-1999||11:47 AM||||When my car was running, I had it as fast 118 MPH.  It is a 86.5 GT, 5 speed, and is/was totally stock!  And when I lived in Tampa, I used to cruise back and forth to Orlando at 100 MPH, with no effort!  Makes for quick trips  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Not that I recomend this to the younger, less skilled members!<BR><p>[This message has been edited by bHooper (edited 11-04-1999).]||||reg||1
